2586
00:02:12,820 --> 00:02:14,200
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Well...-OG}Well, then...{WF}</font>

2587
00:02:17,490 --> 00:02:19,490
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{I should get going, too...-OG}I should also be on my way.{WF}</font>

2588
00:02:19,490 --> 00:02:21,950
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{He said it's in the mortuary
