is west of here...{Z}</font>

2589
00:02:31,710 --> 00:02:33,220
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82"><i>You missed...{Arabasta 16 - 22:01}</i></font>

2590
00:02:44,060 --> 00:02:46,520
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">That was close!
I thought I was a goner!</font>

2591
00:02:50,940 --> 00:02:53,360
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{That bastard... He's gone now...-OG}That jerk... He's gone now...{WF}</font>

2592
00:02:55,030 --> 00:02:57,320
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">I saw him flying that way!</font>

2593
00:02:57,740 --> 00:02:59,330
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">I won't let him get away!</font>

2594
00:02:59,330 --> 00:03:00,830
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{That gator!-OG}That damn croc!{WF}</font>

2595
