2597
00:03:00,830 --> 00:03:05,080
<font face="Chinacat" size="99"><b>{\an8}<font face="DFPGiHi-W7-Strp"></font></b><font color="#f9fafb">Mortuary Temple
(Royal Mausoleum)
West of the Palace</font></font>

2598
00:03:11,630 --> 00:03:14,220
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">So this is the royal mausoleum...</font>

2599
00:03:14,220 --> 00:03:17,050
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{where the bodies
of generations of kings sleep...-OG}the final resting place
for generations of kings.{WF}</font>

2600
00:03:19,680 --> 00:03:21,180
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Where's the poneglyph?</font>

2601
00:03:33,740 --> 00:03:34,740
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Hidden stairs!-OG}A hidden passage!{Polly}</font>

2602
00:03:36,320 --> 00:03:39,660
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{The poneglyph is deep underground.-OG}The poneglyph lies deep underground.{WF}</font>

2603
00:03:40,950 --> 00:03:44,700
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Normally, people aren't even aware
of poneglyphs' existence...-OG}Most people aren't even aware
of the poneglyphs' existence.{WF}</font>

2604
00:03:44,700 --> 00:03:46,710
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{What's happening behind
the scenes is deep.-OG}The criminal underworld is vast.{CPS, WF}{she's saying the underworld (like the shady part of the world) is deep (vast), so even tho he is a king of the world government, that doesn't mean he'd know everything about it-TL from PP}</font>

2605
00:03:46,710 --> 00:03:51,920
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Even if countries belong to the World Government, it doesn't mean their kings know everything.-OG}Even the kings under 
the World Government don't know everything.{Z}</font>

2606
00:03:52,710 --> 00:03:54,210
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{You aren't to be blamed...-OG}Don't beat yourself up.{WF}</font>

2607
00:03:55,300 --> 00:04:00,510
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{since you probably didn't know
there was someone in this world who can decipher them.-OG}You probably didn't know there was
someone out there who could read them.{WF+Gord}</font>

2608
00:04:00,510 --> 00:04:02,640
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">You can read poneglyphs?</font>

2609
00:04:02,640 --> 00:04:03,770
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Yes...</font>

2610
00:04:03,770 --> 00:04:07,270
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">That's why Crocodile and I teamed up.</font>

2611
00:04:07,270 --> 00:04:09,730
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Because of that, he can't kill me.-OG}Because of that,
I'm indispensable to him.{WF}</font>

2612
00:04:10,350 --> 00:04:15,820
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{It's likely that the poneglyph
in this country tells where Pluton is.-OG}It's likely that the poneglyph in this country
has the location of Pluton inscribed on it.{PP}</font>

2613
00:04:15,820 --> 00:04:16,650
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Isn't that right?-OG}Am I right?{WF}</font>

2614
00:04:17,320 --> 00:04:18,530
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{I don't know.-OG}I have no idea.{WF}</font>

2615
00:04:18,530 --> 00:04:22,740
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Arabasta's royal family has been
obligated for generations to protect it.-OG}Arabasta's royal family has been tasked
with protecting it for generations.{WF}</font>

2616
00:04:22,740 --> 00:04:25,120
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">That's all it is to us.</font>

2617
00:04:25,120 --> 00:04:26,620
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Protect?!-OG}Protecting it?{WF}</font>

2618
00:04:26,620 --> 00:04:27,580
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Don't make me laugh!</font>

2619
00:04:34,250 --> 00:04:36,260
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{What an impressive-looking place...-OG}Quite impressive...{WF+Z}</font>

2620
00:04:36,260 --> 00:04:38,840
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{It's behind the doors in the back.-OG}It rests beyond the doors at the end.{WF+Z}</font>

2621
00:04:47,350 --> 00:04:48,940
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Indeed...</font>

2622
00:04:59,110 --> 00:05:00,280
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{You small fry...!-OG}You vermin...{WF}</font>

2623
00:05:01,360 --> 00:05:02,620
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{What the heck are you doing?!-OG}What's wrong with you?!{CPS, WF}</font>

2624
00:05:03,030 --> 00:05:06,200
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{What am I doing?! I'm trying to put
myself in Crocodile's shoes!-OG}What?! I'm trying to put
myself in Crocodile's shoes!{WF}</font>

2625
00:05:06,200 --> 00:05:08,580
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Like, if I were him, where would I
shoot a cannon from...?-OG}Like, "Where would I
shoot a cannon from?!"{Z}</font>

2626
00:05:08,580 --> 00:05:11,040
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Forget it! Just look for the cannoneer!
We've got less than five minutes!-OG}Well, stop! We've got
five minutes to find it!{CPS, WF}</font>

2627
00:05:11,500 --> 00:05:14,920
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Five more minutes! A million lives
will be blown up in five minutes!-OG}Five minutes! A million lives
will be lost in five more minutes!{WF}</font>

2628
00:05:14,920 --> 00:05:18,050
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{We gotta hurry...! We gotta hurry up
and find the cannoneer!-OG}We've gotta hurry...! We've gotta
hurry up and find the cannoneer!{PJ}</font>

2629
00:05:18,050 --> 00:05:20,510
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Chopper! Can't you find
the guy by using your nose?-OH}Chopper! Can't you just
sniff this guy out?!{WF}</font>

2630
00:05:20,510 --> 00:05:23,720
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{I can't. The smell of gunpowder
is all over the town!-OG}{No can do! The only thing
I can smell is all this gunpowder-WF}I'm sorry, but all I can smell
right now is gunpowder!{WF}</font>

2631
00:05:23,720 --> 00:05:25,390
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Then... listen!</font>

2632
00:05:25,390 --> 00:05:28,980
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Find the smell of "a cannoneer who may be
aiming at the center of the Square."-OG}Can you sniff out "a guy who's
aiming a cannon at the square"?{CPS, another one I'm open to ideas on. WF}</font>

2633
00:05:28,980 --> 00:05:30,270
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{What kind of smell is that?-OG}How does <i>that</i> smell?!{CPS, WF}</font>

2634
00:05:30,270 --> 00:05:32,190
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{How should I know?! Try your best!-OG}How should I know?! Just try!{WF}</font>

2635
00:05:32,190 --> 00:05:33,350
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">What?!</font>

2636
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:38,730
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{A cannonball that can blow up
a 5 km diameter...-OG}It can level a five-kilometer area...{T+Z}</font>

2637
00:05:40,280 --> 00:05:42,780
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Wait. Then it must be big...-OG}Wait! Then it's gotta be pretty big...{WF}</font>

2638
00:05:42,780 --> 00:05:46,280
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{If it is to be shot from a cannon,
it won't travel very far...-OG}And if it's being fired from
a cannon, it can't go very far...{WF+Gord}</font>

2639
00:05:46,280 --> 00:05:49,250
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Then it should be closer
to the square after all?!-OG}Then it's closer to
the square after all?!{Z}</font>

2640
00:05:50,000 --> 00:05:52,120
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">I don't have time to go around!</font>

2641
00:05:52,620 --> 00:05:53,960
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{I'll take a shortcut!-OG}I'm making a shortcut!{WF}</font>

2642
00:05:55,250 --> 00:05:56,460
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{How is it from the sky, Pell?!-OG}Find anything, Pell?!{CPS, WF}</font>

2643
00:05:56,460 --> 00:06:01,090
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{I searched every corner of the rooftops
of the buildings near the Square, but I saw no preparations
for the cannon anywhere.-OG}I checked every rooftop near the square,
but there were no signs of a cannon!{CPS, WF}</font>

2644
00:06:01,510 --> 00:06:04,300
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Then... it might be from
somewhere inside a building...-OG}Then... maybe it's inside
one of these buildings...!{WF}</font>

2645
00:06:04,300 --> 00:06:05,720
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{I'll search all of them!-OG}I'll search every last one!{WF}</font>

2646
00:06:05,720 --> 00:06:06,760
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Okay!-OG}All right!{PP}</font>

2647
00:06:19,110 --> 00:06:21,610
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82"><i>{How many times do you have to come
at me before you're satisfied?-OG}What's it going to take
for you to just stay down?!{CPS, WF}{new flashback?}</i></font>

2648
00:06:33,080 --> 00:06:34,960
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Crocodile...</font>

2649
00:06:36,460 --> 00:06:39,210
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Looks like you were taken
down by that woman...-OG}Looks like you were
no match for her...{WF}</font>

2650
00:06:39,210 --> 00:06:42,630
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{I never thought that you'd follow
me to this town... Marines...-OG}I'm surprised the Marines
followed me all the way here.{WF+Polly}</font>

2651
00:06:43,470 --> 00:06:45,510
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Where's your boss?</font>

2652
00:06:45,510 --> 00:06:47,890
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Did that smoke bastard run away?</font>

2653
00:06:48,470 --> 00:06:51,060
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Losers can't speak about justice.-OG}Losers shouldn't preach about justice.{WF}</font>

2654
00:06:51,060 --> 00:06:53,680
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{We're in that kind of sea.-OG}This sea is for the mighty.{WF}</font>

2655
00:06:53,680 --> 00:06:57,810
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Go back to your base and just devote
your time to talking about justice.-OG}If you want to prattle on about justice,
do it from the safety of your base.{WF}</font>

2656
00:07:08,280 --> 00:07:09,700
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Crocodile!</font>

2657
00:07:21,170 --> 00:07:22,340
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Straw Hat!</font>

2658
00:07:23,130 --> 00:07:25,300
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Where did... the gator go?-OG}Where did... that damn croc go?!{WF}</font>

2659
00:07:27,970 --> 00:07:29,010
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Tell me!</font>

2660
00:07:29,010 --> 00:07:30,180
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Where's the gator?!-OG}Where's that croc?!{WF}</font>

2661
00:07:46,070 --> 00:07:48,450
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{He went in the direction
of the mortuary temple.-OG}He's headed toward
the mortuary temple.{CPS, WF}</font>

2662
00:07:48,820 --> 00:07:50,450
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">That way?! Thanks!</font>

2663
00:08:04,210 --> 00:08:06,090
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">What justice...?</font>

2664
00:08:13,310 --> 00:08:16,020
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{The hell with Marine Headquarters...-OG}{Some Marine I am...!-WF}To hell with Marine Headquarters...!{WF}{I think she’s self-deprecating, because she represents “Marine Headquarters” and she makes it seem like a joke, this feels like she is upset at the Marine Headquarters instead-TL from PP}</font>

2665
00:08:25,230 --> 00:08:26,490
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Oh?</font>

2666
00:08:26,490 --> 00:08:28,200
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{I can't move well...-OG}I'm having trouble moving...{WF}</font>

2667
00:08:30,030 --> 00:08:32,950
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{This is strange... when I ate meat...-OG}That's weird... I ate plenty of meat...{WF}</font>

2668
00:08:33,580 --> 00:08:35,660
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{What's wrong...?
These are such small wounds...-OG}What's wrong?
It's just some scratches...{WF}</font>

2669
00:08:36,790 --> 00:08:39,460
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{I wonder if I'm a little tired...-OG}{Maybe... I just need a little nap...-WF}Maybe... I'm a little tired...{Z}</font>

2670
00:08:42,080 --> 00:08:45,960
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Did you find what
you were looking for?-WF}Did it tell you what
you wanted to know?{OG}</font>

2671
00:08:53,430 --> 00:08:55,390
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Oh, I see...-OG}Ah, there we are...{WF}</font>

2672
00:08:55,390 --> 00:08:57,600
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Hidden stairs...-OG}A hidden staircase.{WF}</font>

2673
00:09:02,690 --> 00:09:05,190
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Four... Four more minutes...!</font>

2674
00:09:27,670 --> 00:09:29,260
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Aren't there any others?!-OG}Aren't there more?{Z}</font>

2675
00:09:29,260 --> 00:09:31,800
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Is this all this country is hiding?-OG}This country isn't hiding any others?{Z}</font>

2676
00:09:31,800 --> 00:09:33,800
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{You're not satisfied?-OG}Are you not satisfied?{ARE YOU NOT ENTERTAINED??? WF}</font>

2677
00:09:33,800 --> 00:09:36,010
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{I kept my promise.-OG}I did as you asked.{WF}</font>

2678
00:09:37,770 --> 00:09:38,930
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Yes...-OG}That you did...{WF}</font>

2679
00:09:40,730 --> 00:09:43,440
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Just as you'd expect
from a national secret...-OG}Now <i>this</i> is what you call
a national secret...{WF}</font>

2680
00:09:43,440 --> 00:09:48,860
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{No matter how
desperately you search, it can't be found unless
you know where it is.-OG}Try as you might, you'd never find it
without knowledge of its location.{WF}</font>

2681
00:09:49,900 --> 00:09:52,740
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{So this is the poneglyph,
huh, Nico Robin?-OG}So, Nico Robin...
this is the poneglyph?{WF+Polly}</font>

2682
00:09:54,410 --> 00:09:55,570
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">That didn't take long.</font>

2683
00:09:56,370 --> 00:09:58,870
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{It's strange, or how should I put it...-OG}It's strange, huh...?{Z}{i think he is saying it feels weird that it took that fast, or that it's done now, like "feel's weird, i dunno..."-TL from PP}</font>

2684
00:09:58,870 --> 00:10:00,870
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Were you able to decipher it?</font>

2685
00:10:00,870 --> 00:10:02,120
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Yes.</font>

2686
00:10:02,120 --> 00:10:05,290
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Good. Now, read
the so-called poneglyph...</font>

2687
00:10:09,380 --> 00:10:14,840
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Kahire conquered Arabasta...in ephemeris year 239.-OG}In the empyreal year 239...
Kahire conquered Arabasta.{WF}</font>

2688
00:10:14,840 --> 00:10:18,970
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{In 260, Tamer ruled
the Bytine dynasty.-OG}In the year 260, Tamer
of the Bytine dynasty ruled.{WF}</font>

2689
00:10:18,970 --> 00:10:23,810
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">In 306, the Taf Cathedral
was completed in Erumalu.</font>

2690
00:10:23,810 --> 00:10:27,270
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">In 325, the hero Mamudine of Oltair–</font>

2691
00:10:27,270 --> 00:10:28,690
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Hey, hey... Wait! Wait!-OG}Hey, quit screwing around!{WF}</font>

2692
00:10:28,690 --> 00:10:31,440
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Is that what we wanna know?!-OG}You think that's what
we've been looking for?!{T}</font>

2693
00:10:31,440 --> 00:10:34,030
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Who cares about the history
of this country?!-OG}Who cares about
this country's history?!{Z}</font>

2694
00:10:34,030 --> 00:10:38,160
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Just tell me the location of the world's most disastrous "military power"
that is sleeping in this country!-OG}Tell me where I can find the world's
most destructive military power!{WF+PJ}</font>

2695
00:10:38,530 --> 00:10:40,410
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Where is Pluton?!</font>

2696
00:10:41,620 --> 00:10:43,080
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{It's not written here.-OG}It doesn't say.{WF}</font>

2697
00:10:43,080 --> 00:10:44,250
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Huh?!</font>

2698
00:10:44,250 --> 00:10:46,750
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{History is the only thing written here.-OG}The only thing recorded 
here is history.{WF}</font>

2699
00:10:46,750 --> 00:10:47,840
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">What?!</font>

2700
00:10:47,840 --> 00:10:49,090
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Pluton...</font>

2701
00:10:49,090 --> 00:10:52,550
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{I didn't see that word
mentioned even once.-OG}That name isn't mentioned here once.{WF}</font>

2702
00:10:54,630 --> 00:10:56,050
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Well...</font>

2703
00:10:56,050 --> 00:10:57,300
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">I see...</font>

