Nico Robin...{Polly}</font>

2730
00:12:34,780 --> 00:12:37,030
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{because I've never...-OG}{because...-WF}After all...{Polly}</font>

2731
00:12:37,650 --> 00:12:40,240
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{trusted anyone...-OG}from the very beginning...{WF}</font>

2732
00:12:40,240 --> 00:12:42,990
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{from the beginning.-OG}I never trusted anyone.{WF}</font>

2733
