2779
00:15:31,540 --> 00:15:34,040
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Okay, then! I'll signal them!</font>

2780
00:15:34,040 --> 00:15:36,830
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{In any case, I'll call everyone!
