<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">What?! W-Wait, Vivi! W-Wait!</font>

2808
00:17:55,050 --> 00:17:56,140
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Hurry!</font>

2809
00:17:55,430 --> 00:17:56,140
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82" color="#d6d6d6">Oh, okay.</font>

2810
00:17:56,720 --> 00:17:59,060
