<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{We found her!-OG}It's the princess!{PP}</font>

2812
00:18:02,270 --> 00:18:05,190
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{She led us right to her!-OG}That signal led us right to her!{WF}</font>

2813
00:18:05,940 --> 00:18:07,940
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{There're still some members
