2820
00:18:28,090 --> 00:18:29,760
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Usopp...</font>

2821
00:18:29,760 --> 00:18:32,470
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Noise...!</font>

2822
00:18:38,180 --> 00:18:40,970
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{So this is... this is the...-OG}So this is... This is my...{Polly}</font>

2823
