2826
00:18:46,610 --> 00:18:48,320
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Stop!-OG}Stop right there!{WF}</font>

2827
00:19:08,790 --> 00:19:10,050
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">You...!</font>

2828
00:19:10,670 --> 00:19:13,010
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{I've cornered you, gator!-OG}I've got you now, you damn croc!{WF}</font>

2829
00:19:14,630 --> 00:19:16,510
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Why are you alive?-OG}How are you still alive?!{WF}</font>

2830
00:19:16,510 --> 00:19:21,010
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{No matter how many times I kill you,
