2833
00:19:27,230 --> 00:19:29,440
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Who on earth is he...?-OG}Just who is this young man...?{WF}</font>

2834
00:19:35,950 --> 00:19:37,410
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Straw Hat...</font>

2835
00:19:40,740 --> 00:19:43,250
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Just how many times
do you want to be killed?-OG}How many times
do I have to kill you?!{WF}</font>

2836
00:19:43,580 --> 00:19:46,370
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{You still haven't returned...-OG}You still haven't given back...{WF}</font>

2837
00:19:46,370 --> 00:19:48,000
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{what you took away...-OG}what you took!{WF}</font>

2838
00:19:49,040 --> 00:19:50,460
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{What I took away...?-OG}What I took?!{WF}</font>

2839
00:19:50,960 --> 00:19:52,250
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Is it money?-OG}Do you mean money?{WF}</font>

2840
00:19:52,710 --> 00:19:53,920
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Fame?</font>

2841
00:19:54,590 --> 00:19:56,050
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Trust?</font>

2842
00:19:56,720 --> 00:19:58,140
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82"><i>Lives</i>?</font>

2843
00:19:58,470 --> 00:19:59,850
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82"><i>Rain</i>?!</font>

2844
00:20:03,970 --> 00:20:05,980
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{What do you want me to return?-OG}What exactly do you
want me to return?!{WF}</font>

2845
00:20:05,980 --> 00:20:08,690
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{There're so many things
that I took away.-OG}I've lost track of all
the things I've taken!{WF}</font>

2846
00:20:09,600 --> 00:20:10,610
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{The country!-OG}This country!{WF}</font>

2847
00:20:11,520 --> 00:20:12,900
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{The country?-OG}This country?{WF}</font>

2848
00:20:12,900 --> 00:20:15,400
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{You say funny things...-OG}You say the damnedest things.{WF}</font>

2849
00:20:15,400 --> 00:20:21,910
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{I'm just about to take this country...
by becoming its king.-OG}{This country will be mine shortly...
I shall become its new king!-WF}This country is about to be mine...
I shall become its new king!{WF+Polly}</font>

2850
00:20:23,200 --> 00:20:27,870
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{When we got to this island,
it was already gone.-OG}When we got here,
it was already long gone.{WF}</font>

2851
00:20:28,370 --> 00:20:30,000
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Her country was gone...!-OG}Her country...!{WF}</font>

2852
00:20:34,460 --> 00:20:36,590
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82"><i>{I'm going to persuade
the Rebel Army...-OG}I have to reason
with the Rebel Army...{WF}{new flashback?}</i></font>

2853
00:20:36,590 --> 00:20:39,470
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82"><i>{because I want no more
shedding of blood!-OG}because I want this bloodshed
to finally come to an end!{WF}</i></font>

2854
00:20:41,720 --> 00:20:47,890
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82"><i>Not long ago, this city
was a verdant paradise.{AR 03 - 07:01 (kinda)}</i></font>

2855
00:20:50,150 --> 00:20:52,020
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82"><i>Please, Vivi!{AR 05 - 02:41}</i></font>

2856
00:20:52,610 --> 00:20:56,360
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82"><i><font color="#fefdfe">You have to stop those fools!{AR 05 - 02:41}</font></i></font>

2857
00:20:56,440 --> 00:20:59,360
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">If this is really her country...</font>

2858
00:21:01,070 --> 00:21:02,570
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82"><i>What's wrong...{AR 05 - 29:13}</i></font>

2859
00:21:02,570 --> 00:21:05,200
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82"><i>with not wanting people to die?!{AR 05 - 29:13}</i></font>

2860
00:21:05,620 --> 00:21:09,710
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82"><i>Just one look at this kingdom
and even I can tell...{AR 05 - 30:03}</i></font>

2861
00:21:11,170 --> 00:21:13,080
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82"><i>what needs to be done!{AR 05 - 30:11}</i></font>

2862
00:21:15,710 --> 00:21:19,760
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82"><i>Do you think it's enough
to risk your life alone?!{AR 05 - 30:24}</i></font>

2863
00:21:20,300 --> 00:21:21,430
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82"><i>I've got–{AR 05 - 30:39}</i></font>

2864
00:21:23,760 --> 00:21:27,720
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82"><i>I-I've got nothing else to give...{AR 05 - 30:42}</i></font>

2865
00:21:30,310 --> 00:21:33,730
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82"><i>Why don't you try risking
all of our lives together?!{AR 05 - 30:49}</i></font>

2866
00:21:33,730 --> 00:21:35,190
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82"><i>{Aren't we crewmates?!-OG}Aren't we friends?!{I wanna change this one lol, WF}{AR 05 - 30:53}</i></font>

2867
00:21:41,660 --> 00:21:44,780
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{If this is really her country...-OG}If this really is her country...{Polly}</font>

2868
00:21:44,780 --> 00:21:46,030
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">she should be...</font>

2869
00:21:46,030 --> 00:21:47,950
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">smiling more!{wow, classic misogynist Luffy. WF}</font>

2870
00:21:50,660 --> 00:21:55,380
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Even if you talk cool, when you don't
have water with you, what can you...-OG}Big talk, but without any water,
you can't even land a single–{WF}</font>

2871
00:22:05,930 --> 00:22:07,430
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{This can't be...-OG}It can't be...{WF}</font>

2872
00:22:07,430 --> 00:22:10,640
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Kicking me without water...-OG}He kicked me without
using any water...{WF}</font>

2873
00:22:14,600 --> 00:22:16,980
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82"><i>If only you hadn't come
to this country...{AR 07 - 15:42}</i></font>

2874
00:22:16,980 --> 00:22:19,940
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82"><i>Arabasta would've remained peaceful!{AR 07 - 15:47}</i></font>

2875
00:22:20,900 --> 00:22:23,150
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82"><i>Isn't it just heartrending?{AR 08 - 16:27}</i></font>

2876
00:22:23,150 --> 00:22:27,580
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82"><i>Love for this country is what
will lead to its destruction.{AR 08 - 16:30}</i></font>

2877
00:22:35,710 --> 00:22:37,090
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Crocodile!</font>

2878
00:22:37,090 --> 00:22:37,630
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Wai–</font>

2879
00:22:51,600 --> 00:22:54,270
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Could it be... you're using...</font>

2880
00:22:57,610 --> 00:22:58,690
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{your blood...?!-OG}your own blood...?{WF}</font>

2881
00:23:00,190 --> 00:23:02,860
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Sand can be hardened
by blood, too, can't it?-OG}Blood can harden sand too, right?{WF}</font>

2882
00:23:13,330 --> 00:23:16,250
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">From Rainbase... to the palace...</font>

2883
00:23:16,250 --> 00:23:19,170
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{and to the underground
mortuary temple...-OG}all the way to the mortuary temple...{WF}</font>

2884
00:23:20,750 --> 00:23:24,670
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{I'll reward you for your
persistence in challenging me,-OG}Since you climbed your way
out of hell twice to challenge me,{WF}</font>

2885
00:23:24,670 --> 00:23:27,220
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{even after living through hell twice...-OG}I'll reward your persistence...{WF}</font>

2886
00:23:27,550 --> 00:23:28,760
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">You bastard...!</font>

2887
00:23:32,850 --> 00:23:35,190
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{as a pirate...-OG}...like a pirate!{WF}</font>

2888
00:23:36,020 --> 00:23:40,520
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{It seems that you want
to beat me up no matter what.-OG}It seems you'll stop
at nothing to take me down.{WF}</font>

2889
00:23:41,150 --> 00:23:45,490
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{And I'll also admit that you're
an annoying enemy to me.-OG}I have to admit, you've become
a real thorn in my side.{WF}</font>

2890
00:23:46,400 --> 00:23:47,530
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">It came off!</font>

2891
00:23:47,530 --> 00:23:48,530
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">What the...?</font>

2892
00:23:49,870 --> 00:23:51,280
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{It's a poisonous hook.-OG}It's a venomous hook.{PJ}</font>

2893
00:23:51,660 --> 00:23:52,620
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{I see...-OG}That right?{WF}</font>

2894
00:23:53,080 --> 00:23:57,580
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{As a competent enough pirate,
you seem to understand...-OG}If you're the real deal,
you should know...{WF}</font>

2895
00:23:58,120 --> 00:24:02,130
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{that a duel between pirates
is always a fight for survival,-OG}that a duel between pirates
is a fight to the death.{WF}</font>

2896
00:24:02,130 --> 00:24:05,420
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{and that there's no such
thing as "playing dirty."-OG}There's no such thing
as "fighting dirty."{WF}</font>

2897
00:24:13,810 --> 00:24:18,520
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{When the explosion happens up there, this place will probably collapse
in one breath as well.-OG}When the square explodes,
this tomb will collapse as well.{WF}</font>

2898
00:24:18,520 --> 00:24:20,690
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{There won't be a fourth round...-WF}This is the last time...{OG}</font>

2899
00:24:20,690 --> 00:24:22,820
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Let's settle it once and for all!-OG}This ends right here, right now!{WF}</font>

2900
00:24:26,440 --> 00:24:29,320
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">The smoke was in
that direction, right?</font>

2901
00:24:30,320 --> 00:24:32,370
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">No, was it this way?</font>

2902
00:24:34,290 --> 00:24:36,120
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">What?! Marines?!</font>

2903
00:24:36,120 --> 00:24:38,080
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Look! It's Roronoa Zoro!</font>

2904
00:24:38,080 --> 00:24:41,500
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Dammit! I didn't realize that
the Marines showed up in this town...-OG}Dammit! I didn't realize the Marines
were running around here, too...!</font>

2905
00:24:41,500 --> 00:24:43,590
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{When I don't have time...-OG}There's no time to spare...{WF}</font>

2906
00:24:43,590 --> 00:24:45,010
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{I guess I can't help it.-OG}Guess I've gotta fight!{WF+Gord}</font>

2907
00:24:45,010 --> 00:24:47,050
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">I'll settle this in three seconds!</font>

2908
00:24:47,050 --> 00:24:49,680
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{You...! Why are you
in a place like this?!-OG}You...! Why are you here?!{WF}</font>

2909
00:24:49,680 --> 00:24:51,010
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{What the heck are you doing?!-OG}What are you doing?!{CPS, WF}</font>

2910
00:24:51,430 --> 00:24:53,470
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{That's what I'd say!-OG}Hey, that's <i>my</i> line!{WF}</font>

2911
00:24:53,470 --> 00:24:54,600
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Roronoa Zoro!</font>

2912
00:24:54,970 --> 00:24:58,600
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Go back! If you go north at the last
corner, you can get to the square!-OG}Back the way you came, north from
the last corner is the square!{Z}</font>

2913
00:24:59,100 --> 00:25:01,100
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Go back and turn right! Not this way!</font>

2914
00:25:01,100 --> 00:25:02,360
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Get moving, moron!-WF}Are you stupid?!{OG}</font>

2915
00:25:02,360 --> 00:25:03,610
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Moron?-WF}Stupid?!{OG}</font>

2916
00:25:03,610 --> 00:25:04,400
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Hurry up!</font>

2917
00:25:04,400 --> 00:25:05,070
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Go!</font>

2918
00:25:05,070 --> 00:25:06,740
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Wh-What?!</font>

2919
00:25:06,740 --> 00:25:08,030
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">What's going on?!</font>

2920
00:25:11,990 --> 00:25:14,370
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Wait! Hold it!</font>

2921
00:25:30,930 --> 00:25:32,680
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Th-Tha... Thank...</font>

2922
00:25:33,510 --> 00:25:35,680
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{We'll assist you!-OG}We'll cover you!{PP}</font>

2923
00:25:35,680 --> 00:25:38,640
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Please stop the explosion
of the Square. Now, hurry!-OG}Please, stop the bombing
of the square! Now, hurry!{WF}</font>

2924
00:25:39,140 --> 00:25:41,270
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Thank you! Hurry, Usopp{-san}!</font>

2925
00:25:41,270 --> 00:25:42,600
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Uh... Yeah!-OG}Uh... Right!{Polly}</font>

2926
00:25:56,120 --> 00:25:58,410
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Hurry! Hurry!</font>

2927
00:25:58,790 --> 00:26:00,040
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{We wasted quite a bit of time!-OG}We lost a lot of time!{CPS, WF}</font>

2928
00:26:00,040 --> 00:26:03,880
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{I don't know why they did,
but if the Marines hadn't helped,-OG}I don't know why the Marines
helped us, but if they hadn't,{WF}</font>

2929
00:26:03,880 --> 00:26:06,090
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{it would've been worse!-OG}it would've been a lot worse!{WF}</font>

2930
00:26:16,180 --> 00:26:17,260
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Idiot! Don't look aside!-OG}{Hey, don't look at that!-CPS, WF}{Hey, eyes on the prize!-CPS, WF}Focus, dummy!{CPS, WF+Polly}</font>

2931
00:26:18,260 --> 00:26:21,940
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{If the attack isn't stopped,
the casualties will be a lot worse!-OG}If we don't stop this attack,
way more people will die!{WF}</font>

2932
00:26:22,560 --> 00:26:23,390
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Right!</font>

2933
00:26:23,390 --> 00:26:27,360
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{The attack can't be
stopped by praying!-OG}{We won't stop anything by praying!-WF}{We won't solve anything
by sitting around and praying!-WF}Prayers aren't what'll stop this attack!{Z}</font>

2934
00:26:30,820 --> 00:26:34,240
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{In two minutes, are we gonna be
winners or dead bodies...?-OG}We have two minutes! It's do or die!{WF}</font>

2935
00:26:35,030 --> 00:26:36,740
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">We still have a minute and a half!</font>

2936
00:26:36,740 --> 00:26:37,160
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Yes...!</font>

2937
00:26:37,160 --> 00:26:38,030
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{You've got us all!-OG}You've got us!{Z}</font>

2938
00:26:38,030 --> 00:26:38,700
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Yes!</font>

2939
00:26:43,790 --> 00:26:44,670
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">There they are!</font>

2940
00:26:44,670 --> 00:26:46,460
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Vivi! Usopp!</font>

2941
00:26:47,380 --> 00:26:49,420
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Nami{-san}! Tony{-kun}!</font>

2942
00:26:49,800 --> 00:26:50,920
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">What's going on?!</font>

2943
00:26:50,920 --> 00:26:52,670
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">The Marines helped us!</font>

2944
00:26:52,670 --> 00:26:54,380
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Did you find the cannoneer?!</font>

2945
00:26:55,010 --> 00:26:57,600
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{We haven't confirmed it yet,
but there's no mistake!-OG}We don't have confirmation,
but I'm positive!{WF}</font>

2946
00:26:58,390 --> 00:27:01,060
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{I must've looked at it many times,
but it was my blind spot.-OG}I looked at it so many times
but never considered it!{WF}</font>

2947
00:27:01,520 --> 00:27:04,730
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{The cannoneer is over there
without a doubt!-OG}The cannoneer is up there,
no doubt about it!{WF}</font>

2948
00:27:07,520 --> 00:27:08,610
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">What?!</font>

2949
00:27:10,110 --> 00:27:11,320
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">The clock tower...</font>

2950
00:27:11,320 --> 00:27:12,360
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">I see!</font>

2951
00:27:12,360 --> 00:27:14,780
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{From that place, he can get
a good shot at the Square!-OG}They'd have a great
shot from up there!{WF}</font>

2952
00:27:15,200 --> 00:27:18,240
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{If only Pell would get here,
we could stop the attack.-OG}If only Pell was here,
we could put a stop to this...!{WF}</font>

2953
00:27:19,370 --> 00:27:20,290
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Pell...!</font>

2954
00:27:29,750 --> 00:27:31,550
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{We don't have time.-OG}We're running out of time!{WF}</font>

2955
00:27:32,210 --> 00:27:36,380
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{If I'm not mistaken, the smoke
rose around here, but...-OG}If I'm not mistaken, the smoke
was rising from here, but...{Polly+Z}</font>

2956
00:27:37,550 --> 00:27:39,890
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Ribbit, ribbit, ribbit, ribbit...</font>

2957
00:27:39,890 --> 00:27:41,060
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Hey, listen.</font>

2958
00:27:41,060 --> 00:27:45,310
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{I just shot down a big bird
using this ribbit-ribbit gun.-OG}I just nailed one hell of a bird
with my Ribbit-Ribbit Gun!{WF}</font>

2959
00:27:50,610 --> 00:27:52,230
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{My blunder...-OG}I was careless...!{WF}</font>

2960
00:28:39,610 --> 00:28:41,990
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Gum-Gum Pisto–</font>

2961
00:29:43,760 --> 00:29:46,510
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Who in the world is he...?</font>

2962
00:29:47,100 --> 00:29:53,060
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Crocodile treated even our kingdom's
proud warriors like worms, and yet...-OG}Crocodile crushed our mightiest
warriors like mere insects, and yet...{WF+Gord}</font>

2963
00:30:00,650 --> 00:30:04,530
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{You were skewered...
buried alive... and dried up...-OG}I skewered you, buried you alive,
and even mummified you...{WF}</font>

2964
00:30:06,620 --> 00:30:11,160
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Even you, who stood
back up after all that...-OG}but even you, who stood
back up after all that...{WF}</font>

2965
00:30:11,160 --> 00:30:13,000
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">won't be able to survive this.</font>

2966
00:30:13,000 --> 00:30:17,000
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Game over...The poison will pass
into your system soon.-OG}Our game is at an end. That venom
will soon spread throughout your body.{WF+PJ}</font>

2967
00:30:17,880 --> 00:30:21,260
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{You don't understand anything!-OG}You just don't get it!{WF}</font>

2968
00:30:23,010 --> 00:30:24,470
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">I wonder what happened...</font>

2969
00:30:26,180 --> 00:30:28,720
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">I don't see Pell anywhere...</font>

2970
00:30:29,310 --> 00:30:30,640
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Say, Vivi.-OG}Hey, Vivi.{Gord}</font>

2971
00:30:30,640 --> 00:30:34,560
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{We can't go up that high
within a minute all by ourselves!-OG}We can't get all the way up there
in a minute! Not by ourselves!{WF}</font>

2972
00:30:34,560 --> 00:30:36,730
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Pell! Where are you?! Hurry!</font>

2973
00:30:37,190 --> 00:30:39,480
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{In any case, we should hurry up, too!-OG}At this point, we have to try!{WF}</font>

2974
00:30:39,900 --> 00:30:41,780
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{We have no choice but to use
the stairs! Where's the entrance–-OG}We'll take the stairs! Here's the entra–{CPS, WF+PP}</font>

2975
00:30:41,780 --> 00:30:43,610
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Hey!</font>

2976
00:30:43,610 --> 00:30:44,360
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">– Huh?!
– Huh?!</font>

2977
00:30:44,360 --> 00:30:47,330
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Nami, my sweet{-san}! Vivi, my love{-chan}!</font>

2978
00:30:47,330 --> 00:30:49,830
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Why are you up there?!-OG}What are you doing up there?!{WF}</font>

2979
00:30:49,830 --> 00:30:51,000
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Why?-OG}What do you mean?!{WF}</font>

2980
00:30:51,000 --> 00:30:54,290
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">You left a message under
the smoke, didn't you?!</font>

2981
00:30:54,670 --> 00:30:58,290
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{It said "clock tower."
That's why I came up here.-OG}It said "clock tower,"
so I came up here.{WF}</font>

2982
00:30:59,300 --> 00:31:00,210
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">What should I do?</font>

2983
00:31:00,880 --> 00:31:02,720
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Where's the cannoneer?</font>

2984
00:31:02,720 --> 00:31:04,880
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{He's at the top! Top!-OG}He's at the top! The top!{Gord}</font>

2985
00:31:04,880 --> 00:31:06,640
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Go up from there and beat him up!-OG}{Go further up and kick their ass!-WF}Go up there and kick some ass!{T+WF+Z}</font>

2986
00:31:06,640 --> 00:31:07,180
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Huh?</font>

2987
00:31:07,550 --> 00:31:08,810
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Huh? Wha...?!</font>

2988
00:31:08,810 --> 00:31:11,310
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Hey, I looked all over for you guys!</font>

2989
00:31:11,310 --> 00:31:13,430
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Zoro! You too?!</font>

2990
00:31:13,430 --> 00:31:15,020
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">What're you doing there?</font>

2991
00:31:15,020 --> 00:31:17,310
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{That's what I'd like to say!-OG}That's <i>my</i> line, moron!{WF}</font>

2992
00:31:17,310 --> 00:31:21,320
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Well, Marine guys kept saying,
"go north," "go north,"-OG}Well, the Marines kept
telling me to go north,{WF}</font>

2993
00:31:21,320 --> 00:31:22,990
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{so I came up here for now...-OG}so I came up here!{WF}</font>

2994
00:31:22,990 --> 00:31:25,280
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{"North" and "up" are totally
different, you know!-OG}"North" and "up" are totally
different, dumbass!{WF}</font>

2995
00:31:25,280 --> 00:31:27,240
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{But in any case, good job!-OG}Well in any case, nice work!{WF}</font>

2996
00:31:27,240 --> 00:31:30,830
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Go up from there
and destroy the clock tower!-OG}Keep heading up
and trash that clock tower!{WF}</font>

2997
00:31:30,830 --> 00:31:31,950
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{No!-OG}They can't!{Z}</font>

2998
00:31:31,290 --> 00:31:31,950
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82" color="#d6d6d6">What?!</font>

2999
00:31:32,410 --> 00:31:35,580
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{They can't go inside the clock tower
from where they are.-OG}The tower is inaccessible
from their current location.{WF}</font>

3000
00:31:35,580 --> 00:31:41,090
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{Other than entering
from the sky, the only way up is the stairs in the back
on the first floor.-OG}Unless you're flying, the only way in
is a staircase at the back of the first floor.{WF}</font>

3001
00:31:41,670 --> 00:31:44,300
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{But Zoro can destroy
the tower wall and...-OG}But Zoro could just smash
through the tower walls...{Polly}</font>

3002
00:31:44,970 --> 00:31:48,550
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{We don't know if the cannonball
can bear that kind of shock!-OG}The cannonball might
explode from the shock!{WF}</font>

3003
00:31:48,550 --> 00:31:50,760
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{We have no choice but
to go up the stairs after all!-OG}We'll have to climb the stairs after all!{CPS, WF}</font>

3004
00:31:50,760 --> 00:31:52,010
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Wait, Vivi!</font>

3005
00:31:52,010 --> 00:31:52,600
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">What?</font>

3006
00:31:53,390 --> 00:31:55,060
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{I've got a good idea!-OG}{I just had an idea!-WF}I've got an idea!{Polly+WF}</font>

3007
00:32:00,020 --> 00:32:03,230
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Ribbit... ribbit, ribbit, ribbit...</font>

3008
00:32:10,660 --> 00:32:12,540
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Hey listen, Mr. 7.</font>

3009
00:32:12,540 --> 00:32:16,500
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{I know that this is our last mission.-OG}This will be our final mission.{WF}</font>

3010
00:32:16,500 --> 00:32:19,000
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">Ribbit, ribbit, ribbit...</font>

3011
