3017
00:32:20,250 --> 00:32:22,170
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{\an8}That's the plan.</font>

3018
00:32:24,170 --> 00:32:27,470
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{\an8}According to the plan,
we have thirty seconds left.</font>

3019
00:32:30,140 --> 00:32:31,300
<font face="Impress BT Pace" size="82">{What's that?!-OG}Who are <i>they</i>?!{WF}</font>

3020
